sequenceDiagram
    participant EvalHub as eval-hub Service
    participant Adapter as GarakAdapter<br/>K8s Job Pod
    participant Core as Core Module<br/>(garak subprocess)
    participant TargetLLM as Target LLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant JudgeLLM as Judge/Attacker/<br/>Evaluator LLMs<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant SDGLLM as SDG LLM<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant KFP as KFP API Server<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 Storage<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant OCI as OCI Registry<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant MLflow as MLflow<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Sidecar as eval-hub Sidecar<br/>8080/TCP HTTP

    Note over EvalHub,Adapter: Flow 1: Simple Mode Scan
    EvalHub->>Adapter: ConfigMap mount<br/>/etc/eval-job/spec.json
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: INITIALIZING<br/>HTTP POST (loopback)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Resolve config,<br/>build garak CLI args
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: RUNNING<br/>HTTP POST (loopback)
    Adapter->>Core: Execute garak subprocess
    Core->>TargetLLM: POST /v1/completions<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    TargetLLM-->>Core: Model response
    Core-->>Adapter: Scan results (JSONL)
    Adapter->>Adapter: Parse results,<br/>compute TBSA scores
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Status: PERSISTING<br/>HTTP POST (loopback)
    Adapter->>OCI: Push scan artifacts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>MLflow: Log metrics & artifacts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Final results (EvaluationResult)<br/>HTTP POST (loopback)

    Note over Adapter,S3: Flow 2: KFP Mode Scan
    Adapter->>KFP: Submit pipeline<br/>TLS 1.2+ / SA Token
    KFP->>S3: validate: check config<br/>TLS 1.2+ / AWS IAM
    KFP->>SDGLLM: sdg_generate: create prompts<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token (SDG_API_KEY)
    SDGLLM-->>KFP: Generated adversarial prompts
    KFP->>TargetLLM: garak_scan: probe model<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    KFP->>JudgeLLM: garak_scan: judge/attack/eval<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    TargetLLM-->>KFP: Model responses
    JudgeLLM-->>KFP: Detection/attack results
    KFP->>S3: write_kfp_outputs: upload results<br/>TLS 1.2+ / AWS IAM
    KFP-->>Adapter: Pipeline run complete
    Adapter->>S3: Download results<br/>TLS 1.2+ / AWS IAM
    S3-->>Adapter: Scan artifacts
    Adapter->>Sidecar: Final results<br/>HTTP POST (loopback)

    Note over Adapter,JudgeLLM: Flow 3: Intents Mode (Escalating Attack Pipeline)
    Adapter->>SDGLLM: Generate adversarial prompts<br/>from harm taxonomy<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    SDGLLM-->>Adapter: SDG output prompts
    Adapter->>Adapter: Generate CAS topology +<br/>intent stub JSONs
    Adapter->>TargetLLM: Baseline probes<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>TargetLLM: SPO augmented probes<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>TargetLLM: Multilingual translation probes<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    Adapter->>JudgeLLM: TAP: tree-of-attack<br/>Attacker generates jailbreaks<br/>Evaluator judges success<br/>TLS 1.2+ / Bearer Token
    JudgeLLM-->>Adapter: Attack + evaluation results
    Adapter->>Adapter: Generate ART HTML report<br/>with Vega-Lite charts
